  "notable_quotes": [
    "With Bu4NBr under solvent-free conditions at 90 °C and 1 MPa for 6 h, Zn(PZDC)(ATZ) catalyzed epoxide/CO2 coupling with TON 131.0 and TOF 21.8 h−1 for propylene carbonate.",
    "Cycloaddition is proposed to proceed via synergistic Lewis acid–base activation by Zn(PZDC)(ATZ) together with nucleophilic Bu4NBr under solvent-free conditions.",
    "Abundant N-containing Lewis base sites in Zn(PZDC)(ATZ) are proposed to enhance CO2 affinity and contribute to high CO2 capture ability."
